	"3-5 yr": "3-5 年",
	"3) The exact line and column are announced, so you know precisely where the match is in the buffer.": "3) 系统将播报确切的行和列，以便你准确了解匹配项在缓冲区中的位置。",
	"3) The exact location information is announced so you know where the match is.": "3) 系统将播报确切的位置信息，以便你了解该匹配项的位置。",
