	"Configure [{0}](command:workbench.action.openSettings?%5B%22{1}%22%5D \"Open Settings\") to start new sessions in Bypass Approvals or Autopilot mode.": "配置 [{0}](command:workbench.action.openSettings?%5B%22{1}%22%5D \"Open Settings\")，以绕过审批模式或 Autopilot 模式启动新会话。",
	"Configure [{0}](command:workbench.action.openSettings?%5B%22chat.editing.autoAcceptDelay%22%5D \"Open Settings\") to automatically accept changes from the agent after a short countdown.": "配置 [{0}](command:workbench.action.openSettings?%5B%22chat.editing.autoAcceptDelay%22%5D \"打开设置\")以在短暂倒计时后自动接受来自智能体的更改。",
	"Configure [glob patterns](https://aka.ms/vscode-glob-patterns) to editors (for example `\"*.hex\": \"hexEditor.hexedit\"`). These have precedence over the default behavior.": "将 [glob 模式](https://aka.ms/vscode-glob-patterns)配置到编辑器(例如 `\"*.hex\": \"hexEditor.hexedit\"`)。这些优先于默认行为。",
	"Configure [glob patterns](https://aka.ms/vscode-glob-patterns) to editors for diff views (for example `\"*.md\": \"vscode.markdown.preview.editor\"`). These override `workbench.editorAssociations` for diffs.": "将 [glob 模式](https://aka.ms/vscode-glob-patterns)配置为编辑器以打开差异视图(例如 `\"*.md\": \"vscode.markdown.preview.editor\"`)。这些设置会覆盖差异视图的 `workbench.editorAssociations`。",
	"Configure [glob patterns](https://aka.ms/vscode-glob-patterns) to editors for opening files from chat (for example `\"*.md\": \"vscode.markdown.preview.editor\"`).": "将 [glob 模式](https://aka.ms/vscode-glob-patterns)配置为编辑器以打开聊天中的文件(例如 `\"*.md\": \"vscode.markdown.preview.editor\"`)。",
