	"Configure which prompt files to recommend in the chat welcome view. Each key is a prompt file name, and the value can be `true` to always recommend, `false` to never recommend, or a [when clause](https://aka.ms/vscode-when-clause) expression like `resourceExtname == .js` or `resourceLangId == markdown`.": "配置要在聊天欢迎视图中推荐的提示文件。每个键都是提示文件名，值可以是 `true`，以表示始终推荐，`false` 则表示从不推荐，也可以是 [when 子句](https://aka.ms/vscode-when-clause)表达式，如 `resourceExtname == .js` or `resourceLangId == markdown`。",
