	"Configures the duration in milliseconds to wait for shell integration to be detected when the run in terminal tool launches a new terminal. Set to `0` to skip the wait entirely, the default value `-1` uses a variable wait time based on the value of {0} and whether it's a remote window. A large value can be useful if your shell starts very slowly.": "配置在终端工具中的运行启动新终端时，等待检测到 shell 集成的持续时间(毫秒)。设置为 `0` 以完全跳过等待，默认值 `-1` 基于 {0} 值以及它是否为远程窗口使用可变等待时间。如果 shell 启动速度非常慢，则大值非常有用。",
	"Configures the idle poll interval in milliseconds used by the run in terminal tool to detect when commands have finished executing. Lower values make command detection faster but may cause false positives on slow systems. This primarily affects terminals without shell integration where idle detection is used instead of shell integration events.": "配置终端工具中运行使用的空闲轮询间隔(以毫秒为单位)，以检测命令何时完成执行。值越低，命令检测速度越快，但在系统速度慢时可能会导致误报。这主要影响没有 shell 集成的终端，其中使用空闲检测而不是 shell 集成事件。",
	"Configures the panel that is used to present the task's output and reads its input.": "配置用于显示任务输出并读取其输入的面板。",
	"Configures the preferred type of edit to use when dropping content.\n\nThis is an ordered list of edit kinds. The first available edit of a preferred kind will be used.": "配置删除内容时要使用的首选编辑类型。\r\n\r\n这是编辑种类的已排序列表。将使用首选种类的第一个可用编辑。",
	"Configures the preferred type of edit to use when pasting content.\n\nThis is an ordered list of edit kinds. The first available edit of a preferred kind will be used.": "配置粘贴内容时要使用的首选编辑类型。\r\n\r\n这是编辑种类的已排序列表。将使用首选种类的第一个可用编辑。",
	"Configures the shell to be used.": "配置使用的 shell。",
	"Configures what percentage is displayed by default for test coverage.": "配置默认情况下针对测试覆盖率显示的具体百分比。",
	"Configures when the error Peek view is automatically opened.": "配置何时自动打开错误“速览”视图。",
	"Configures when the task should be run. If set to folderOpen, then the task will be run automatically when the folder is opened. If set to worktreeCreated, then the task will be run automatically when an Agent Session worktree is created.": "配置何时应运行任务。如果设置为 folderOpen，任务将在打开文件夹时自动运行。如果设置为 worktreeCreated，则任务将在创建代理会话工作树时自动运行。",
	"Configures whether the default language icons should be used if the theme does not define an icon for a language.": "配置如果主题未为某个语言定义图标，是否应使用默认语言图标。",
	"Configures whether the file explorer's arrows should be hidden when this theme is active.": "配置文件资源管理器的箭头是否应在此主题启用时隐藏。",
	"Configures whether to show the problem matcher prompt when running a task. Set to `true` to never prompt, or use a dictionary of task types to turn off prompting only for specific task types.": "配置在运行任务时是否显示问题匹配器提示。设置为\"true\"从不提示，或使用任务类型的字典仅关闭特定任务类型的提示。",
