	"Declares whether the extension should be enabled in virtual workspaces. A virtual workspace is a workspace which is not backed by any on-disk resources. When false, this extension will be automatically disabled in virtual workspaces. Default is true.": "声明是否应在虚拟工作区中启用扩展。虚拟工作区是一个不受任何磁盘资源支持的工作区。当为 false 时，会在虚拟工作区中自动禁用此扩展。默认值为 true。",
