	"Deferring to user's input in the terminal": "等待用户在终端输入",
	"Define common guidelines and rules that automatically influence how AI generates code and handles development tasks.": "定义通用准则和规则，它们会自动影响 AI 生成代码和处理开发任务的方式。",
	"Define custom agents with specialized personas, tool access, and instructions for specific tasks.": "定义具有专属角色、工具访问权限和特定任务指令的自定义智能体。",
	"Define guidance that shapes how agents work. Apply it across a workspace or keep it in your user profile.": "设置始终生效的指令，在整个工作区或用户配置文件中引导 AI 行为。",
	"Defined as a location where voice recording from microphone is in progress for voice chat. This key is only defined scoped, per chat context.": "定义为正在录制麦克风语音以进行语音聊天的位置。此密钥仅根据聊天上下文定义范围。",
	"Defines a default folding range provider that takes precedence over all other folding range providers. Must be the identifier of an extension contributing a folding range provider.": "定义优先于所有其他折叠范围提供程序的默认折叠范围提供程序。必须是提供折叠范围提供程序的扩展的标识符。",
	"Defines a default formatter which takes precedence over all other formatter settings. Must be the identifier of an extension contributing a formatter.": "定义一个默认格式化程序, 该格式化程序优先于所有其他格式化程序设置。必须是提供格式化程序的扩展的标识符。",
	"Defines a list of scopes where the auto pairs are disabled.": "定义禁用了自动配对的作用域列表。",
	"Defines how and if the renderer needs to communicate with an extension host, via `createRendererMessaging`. Renderers with stronger messaging requirements may not work in all environments.": "定义呈现器是否需要通过 \"createRendererMessaging\" 与扩展主机通信。具有较强消息传递要求的呈现器可能在所有环境中都不起作用。",
	"Defines how block comments are marked.": "定义块注释的标记方式。",
	"Defines how file names reported in a problem pattern should be interpreted. A relative fileLocation may be an array, where the second element of the array is the path of the relative file location. The search fileLocation mode, performs a deep (and, possibly, heavy) file system search within the directories specified by the include/exclude properties of the second element (or the current workspace directory if not specified).": "定义应如何解释问题模式中报告的文件名。相对 fileLocation 可以是数组，其中数组的第二个元素是相对文件位置的路径。搜索 fileLocation 模式会在由第二个元素的 include/exclude 属性指定的目录(如果未指定，则为当前工作区目录)中执行深层(而且可能是大量的)文件系统搜索。",
	"Defines if this task is the default task in the group, or a glob to match the file which should trigger this task.": "定义此任务是组中的默认任务，还是与应触发此任务的文件匹配的 glob。",
	"Defines the bracket pairs that are colorized by their nesting level if bracket pair colorization is enabled. Any brackets included here that are not included in {0} will be automatically included in {0}.": "定义在启用括号对着色时由其嵌套级别着色的括号对。此处包含的任何不包含在{0}中的括号都将自动包含在{0}中。",
	"Defines the bracket pairs that can be used to surround a selected string.": "定义可用于包围所选字符串的括号对。",
	"Defines the bracket pairs. When a opening bracket is entered, the closing bracket is inserted automatically.": "定义括号对。当输入左方括号时，将自动插入右方括号。",
	"Defines the bracket symbols that increase or decrease the indentation. When bracket pair colorization is enabled and {0} is not defined, this also defines the bracket pairs that are colorized by their nesting level.": "定义增加或减少缩进的括号符号。当方括号对着色已启用且未定义{0}时，这还将定义按其嵌套级别着色的括号对。",
	"Defines the comment symbols": "定义注释符号",
	"Defines the role and aria label to be used when the status bar entry is focused.": "定义在状态栏条目聚焦时要使用的角色和 aria 标签。",
	"Defines the version of the extension for which the override should be applied. If not specified, the override will be applied independent of the extension version.": "定义应应用替代的扩展的版本。如果未指定，则将在独立于扩展版本的情况下应用替代。",
	"Defines to which execution group this task belongs to. It supports \"build\" to add it to the build group and \"test\" to add it to the test group.": "定义此任务属于的执行组。它支持 \"build\" 以将其添加到生成组，也支持 \"test\" 以将其添加到测试组。",
	"Defines what characters must be after the cursor in order for bracket or quote autoclosing to occur when using the 'languageDefined' autoclosing setting. This is typically the set of characters which can not start an expression.": "在自动闭合设置为 \"languageDefined\" 时，定义使括号或引号自动闭合的光标后面的字符。通常是不会成为表达式开头的一组字符。",
	"Defines what is considered to be a word in the programming language.": "定义一下在编程语言里什么东西会被当做是一个单词。",
	"Defines whether the task is executed as a process and the output is shown in the output window or inside the terminal.": "定义任务是否作为进程执行，输出显示在输出窗口还是在终端内。",
	"Defines whether the task is run as a process or as a command inside a shell.": "定义任务是被作为进程运行还是在 shell 中作为命令运行。",
	"Defines which scope names contain balanced brackets.": "定义哪些范围名称包含平衡括号。",
	"Defines which scope names do not contain balanced brackets.": "定义哪些范围名称不包含平衡括号。",
	"Definitions": "定义",
	"Delay after which changes made by chat are automatically accepted. Values are in seconds, `0` means disabled and `100` seconds is the maximum.": "自动接受聊天所做更改的延迟时间。值以秒为单位，`0` 表示禁用，最大为 `100` 秒。",
	"Delegate Session": "委托会话",
	"Delegate Task": "委派任务",
	"Delegate tasks to a background agent running locally on your machine. The agent iterates via chat and works asynchronously in a Git worktree to implement changes isolated from your main workspace using the GitHub Copilot CLI.": "将任务委托给在计算机上本地运行的后台代理程序。智能体通过聊天循环访问，并在 Git 工作树中异步工作，以使用 GitHub Copilot CLI 实现与主工作区隔离的更改。",
	"Delegate tasks to other agents": "将任务委派给其他智能体",
	"Delegate tasks to the Claude Agent SDK using the Claude models included in your GitHub Copilot subscription. The agent iterates via chat and works interactively to implement changes on your main workspace.": "使用 GitHub Copilot 订阅中包含的 Claude 模型，将任务委派给 Claude Agent SDK。智能体通过聊天循环访问，并以交互方式在主工作区上实现更改。",
	"Delegate tasks to the GitHub Copilot coding agent. The agent iterates via chat and works asynchronously in the cloud to implement changes and pull requests as needed.": "将任务委托给 GitHub Copilot 编码智能体。智能体通过聊天循环访问，并在云中异步工作，以根据需要实现更改和拉取请求。",
