	"Determines whether the tab key moves focus around the workbench or inserts the tab character in the current editor. This is also called tab trapping, tab navigation, or tab focus mode.": "确定 Tab 键是在工作台周围移动焦点，还是在当前编辑器中插入制表符。这也称为制表符补漏白、制表符导航或制表符焦点模式。",
	"Determines whether the up arrow key navigates the command history when focus is on the first suggestion and navigation has not yet occurred. When set to false, the up arrow will move focus to the last suggestion instead.": "确定当焦点位于第一个建议上且尚未进行导航时，向上键是否导航命令历史记录。设置为 false 时，向上箭会改为将焦点移动到最后一个建议。",
