	"Dictation allows you to write code and text using your voice. It can be activated with the Voice: Start Dictation in Editor command.\n{0}\n For dictation in the terminal, use the Voice: Start Dictation in Terminal and Voice: Stop Dictation in Terminal commands.\n{1}\n{2}": "听写功能允许你通过语音编写代码和文本。可使用“语音: 在编辑器中开始听写”命令来激活它。\r\n{0}\r\n 在终端中进行听写时，请使用“语音: 在终端开始听写”和“语音: 在终端停止听写”命令。\r\n{1}\r\n{2}",
	"Did you forget to escape the '/' (slash) character? Put two backslashes before it to escape, e.g., '\\\\/'.": "忘记转义 \"/\"(斜杠)字符了吗? 在该字符前放置两个反斜杠以进行转义，例如 \"\\\\/\"。",
	"Did you forget to write an expression? You can also put 'false' or 'true' to always evaluate to false or true, respectively.": "忘记写入表达式了吗? 还可以放置 \"false\" 或 \"true\" 以始终分别评估为 false 或 true。",
