	"Font style of the rule: 'italic', 'bold', 'underline', 'strikethrough' or a combination. The empty string unsets inherited settings.": "这条规则的字形: \"italic\" (斜体)、\"bold\" (粗体)、\"underline\" (下划线)、\"strikethrough\" (删除线) 或是上述的组合。空字符串将取消继承的设置。",
