	"In a multi line matcher loop indicated whether this pattern is executed in a loop as long as it matches. Can only specified on a last pattern in a multi line pattern.": "在多行中，匹配程序循环指示是否只要匹配就在循环中执行此模式。只能在多行模式的最后一个模式上指定。",
