	"In the accessible view, you can:\n": "在辅助视图中，可以:\r\n",
	"In the editor, Keep{0}, Undo{1}, or Toggle the Diff{2} for the current Change.": "在编辑器中，保留{0}、撤消{1}或切换当前更改的差异{2}。",
	"In the input box, inspect the last response in the accessible view{0}. Thinking content is included in order by default.": "在输入框中，在辅助视图 {0} 中检查最后一个响应。思考内容按默认顺序排列。",
	"In the input box, inspect the response in the accessible view{0}.": "在输入框中，在辅助视图 {0} 中检查响应。",
	"In the input box, use Show Previous{0} and Show Next{1} to navigate your request history. Edit input and use enter or the submit button to run a new request.": "在输入框中，使用“显示上一条{0}”和“显示下一条{1}”来浏览请求历史记录。编辑输入，并使用 Enter 或“提交”按钮来运行新请求。",
	"In the input box, use up and down arrows to navigate your request history. Edit input and use enter or the submit button to run a new request.": "在输入框中，使用向上和向下箭头导航请求历史记录。编辑输入并使用 Enter 或提交按钮运行新请求。",
