	"Incoming content background in inline merge-conflicts. The color must not be opaque so as not to hide underlying decorations.": "内联合并冲突中的传入内容背景。颜色必须透明，以免隐藏下面的修饰效果。",
	"Incoming header background in inline merge-conflicts. The color must not be opaque so as not to hide underlying decorations.": "内联合并冲突中的传入标题背景。颜色必须透明，以免隐藏下面的修饰效果。",
