	"Incompatible protocol version. We speak {0}. Error from {1}: {2}\n\n Ensure {3} and {1} are both up to date.": "协议版本不兼容。我们使用 {0}。来自 {1} 的错误: {2}\r\n\r\n 请确保 {3} 和 {1} 均为最新版本。",
