	"Incorrect type. Expected \"{0}\". The field 'command' does not support running multiple commands. Use command 'runCommands' to pass it multiple commands to run.": "类型错误。应为 \"{0}\"。字段 \"command\" 不支持运行多个命令。使用命令 \"runCommands\" 以向它传递多个要运行的命令。",
	"Incorrect type. Expected \"boolean\".": "类型错误，预期为“布尔”。",
