	"On mobile, the mode and model pickers appear as tappable chips below the input. Tap a chip to open a bottom sheet where you can change the selection.": "在移动设备上，模式和模型选取器以可点击的标签形式显示在输入框下方。点击标签打开底部工作表，即可更改选择。",
	"Once downloaded, please manually install the downloaded VSIX of '{0}'.": "下载后，请手动安装“{0}”的 VSIX。",
	"Once the edits are applied, a sound will play to indicate the document has been opened and is ready for review. The sound can be disabled with accessibility.signals.chatEditModifiedFile.": "应用编辑后，将播放声音以指示文档已打开并且可供审阅。可以使用 accessibility.signals.chatEditModifiedFile 禁用声音。",
	"Once the limit is reached, additional budget will be used.": "达到限制后使用额外预算。",
	"Once the limit is reached, premium request budget will be used.": "达到限制后，将使用高级请求预算。",
	"Once the prefix breaks at messages[{0}], everything after it is recomputed regardless — fix the first break first.": "一旦前缀在消息[{0}]处中断，之后的所有内容都会重新计算 - 请先修复第一个中断。",
	"One or more agents that this agent can use as subagents. Use '*' to specify all available agents.": "此智能体可用作子智能体的一个或多个智能体。使用 \"*\" 指定所有可用智能体。",
	"One or more agents to exclude from using this instruction file.": "排除使用此指令文件的一个或多个智能体。",
	"One or more glob pattern (separated by comma) that describe for which files the instructions apply to. Based on these patterns, the file is automatically included in the prompt, when the context contains a file that matches one or more of these patterns. Use `**` when you want this file to always be added.\nExample: `**/*.ts`, `**/*.js`, `client/**`": "一个或多个 glob 模式(用逗号分隔)，用于描述指令应用于哪些文件。根据这些模式，当上下文包含与其中一个或多个模式匹配的文件时，该文件会自动包含在提示中。如果希望始终添加此文件，请使用 `**`。\r\n示例: `**/*.ts`、`**/*.js`、`client/**`",
	"One or more snippets from the extension '{0}' very likely confuse snippet-variables and snippet-placeholders (see https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/userdefinedsnippets#_snippet-syntax for more details)": "扩展“{0}”中的一个或多个代码片段很可能混淆了片段变量和片段占位符 (有关详细信息，请访问 https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/userdefinedsnippets#_snippet-syntax )",
	"Online": "在线",
	"only {0} shown for performance reasons": "出于性能原因，仅显示了 {0}",
	"Only automatically start new MCP servers that have never been run.": "仅自动启动从未运行过的新 MCP 服务器。",
