	"Opacity of unnecessary (unused) source code in the editor. For example, \"#000000c0\" will render the code with 75% opacity. For high contrast themes, use the  'editorUnnecessaryCode.border' theme color to underline unnecessary code instead of fading it out.": "非必须(未使用)代码的在编辑器中显示的不透明度。例如，\"#000000c0\" 将以 75% 的不透明度显示代码。对于高对比度主题，请使用 ”editorUnnecessaryCode.border“ 主题来为非必须代码添加下划线，以避免颜色淡化。",
