	"Plugin marketplaces to query. Entries may be GitHub shorthand (`owner/repo` or `owner/repo#ref`), direct Git repository URIs (`https://...git`, `ssh://...git`, or `git@host:path.git`, each optionally suffixed with `#ref`), or local repository URIs (`file:///...`). Equivalent GitHub shorthand and URI entries are deduplicated.": "要查询的插件市场。条目可以是 GitHub 速记(`owner/repo` 或 `owner/repo#ref`)、直接 Git 存储库 URI (`https://...git`、`ssh://...git` 或 `git@host:path.git`，可以选择为每项附加后缀 `#ref`)，也可以是本地存储库 URI (`file:///...`)。等效的 GitHub 速记和 URI 条目会被去重。",
