	"Set the color mode for native UI elements such as native dialogs, menus and title bar. Even if your OS is configured in light color mode, you can select a dark system color theme for the window. You can also configure to automatically adjust based on the {0} setting.\n\nNote: This setting is ignored when {1} is enabled.": "设置本机 UI 元素的颜色模式，例如本机对话框、菜单和标题栏。即使在浅色模式下配置 OS，也可以为窗口选择深色系统颜色主题。还可以配置为根据 {0} 设置自动调整。\r\n\r\n注意: 启用 {1} 时会忽略此设置。",
	"Set the models the server can use via MCP sampling": "设置服务器可通过 MCP 采样使用的模型",
	"Set the root path for extensions.": "设置扩展的根路径。",
	"Set to {0} to automatically approve commands, {1} to always require explicit approval or {2} to unset the value.": "设置为 {0} 可自动批准命令，设置为 {1} 始终需要显式批准，设置为 {2} 则可取消设置值。",
	"Set to false to hide from the / menu. Use for background knowledge users should not invoke directly. Default: true.": "设置为 false 可在 / 菜单中隐藏。用于不应由用户直接调用的后台知识。默认值: true。",
	"Set to true to prevent the agent from automatically loading this skill. Use for workflows you want to trigger manually with /name. Default: false.": "设置为 true 可防止代理自动加载此技能。用于你想要通过 /name 手动触发的工作流。默认值: false。",
	"Set up Copilot to use AI features.": "设置 Copilot 以使用 AI 功能。",
	"Sets `fish_private_mode` to prevent any command from entering history": "设置 `fish_private_mode`，防止任何命令进入历史记录中",
	"Sets `HIST_IGNORE_SPACE` option and prepends the command with space": "设置 `HIST_IGNORE_SPACE` 选项并在命令前添加空格",
	"Sets `HISTCONTROL=ignorespace` and prepends the command with space": "设置 `HISTCONTROL=ignorespace` 并在命令前添加空格",
	"Sets a custom history handler via PSReadLine's `AddToHistoryHandler` to prevent any command from entering history": "通过 PSReadLine 的 `AddToHistoryHandler` 设置自定义历史记录处理程序，防止任何命令进入历史记录中",
	"Sets colors and styles using textmate theming rules (advanced).": "使用 TextMate 主题规则设置颜色和样式(高级)。",
	"Sets or unsets the font style to bold. Note, the presence of 'fontStyle' overrides this setting.": "将字形设置为粗体或取消粗体设置。请注意，如果存在 \"fontStyle\"，则会替代此设置。",
	"Sets or unsets the font style to italic. Note, the presence of 'fontStyle' overrides this setting.": "将字形设置为倾斜或取消倾斜设置。请注意，如果存在 \"fontStyle\"，则会替代此设置。",
	"Sets or unsets the font style to strikethrough. Note, the presence of 'fontStyle' overrides this setting.": "将字形设置为下划线或取消下划线设置。请注意，如果存在 \"fontStyle\"，则会替代此设置。",
	"Sets or unsets the font style to underline. Note, the presence of 'fontStyle' overrides this setting.": "将字形设置为下划线或取消下划线设置。请注意，如果存在 \"fontStyle\"，则会替代此设置。",
	"Sets problem matcher prompting behavior for all tasks.": "为所有任务设置问题匹配器提示行为。",
	"Sets the all font styles of the rule: 'italic', 'bold', 'underline' or 'strikethrough' or a combination. All styles that are not listed are unset. The empty string unsets all styles.": "设置规则的所有字形: \"italic\" (斜体)、\"bold\" (粗体)、\"underline\" (下划线)、\"strikethrough\" (删除线) 或是上述的组合。所有未列出的字形都将取消设置。空字符串将取消设置的所有字形。",
	"Sets the colors and styles for variables declarations and references.": "设置变量定义和引用的颜色和样式。",
	"Sets the default chat model for new conversations. Accepts \"auto\", a model family name (such as \"opus\" or \"gemini\"), or a full model id. Users can still switch the model within a conversation.": "设置新对话的默认聊天模型。接受“自动”、模型系列名称(例如 \"opus\" 或 \"gemini\")或完整模型 ID。用户仍然可以在对话中切换模型。",
	"Sets the initial telemetry level. Valid levels are: 'off', 'crash', 'error' and 'all'. If not specified, the server will send telemetry until a client connects, it will then use the clients telemetry setting. Setting this to 'off' is equivalent to --disable-telemetry": "设置初始遥测级别。有效级别为: “off”、 crash”、“error” 和 “all”。如果未指定，服务器将在客户端连接之前发送遥测数据，然后将使用客户端遥测设置。将此项设置为 “off” 等效于 --disable-telemetry",
	"Sets the slow provider warning for all tasks.": "为所有任务设置慢速提供程序警告。",
	"Sets the source from which ports are automatically forwarded when {0} is true. When {0} is false, {1} will be used to find information about ports that have already been forwarded. On Windows and macOS remotes, the `process` and `hybrid` options have no effect and `output` will be used.": "设置当 {0} 为 true 时自动从其转发端口的源。当 {0} 为 false 时，{1} 将用于查找有关已转发的端口的信息。在 Windows 和 Mac 远程设备上，“process”和“hybrid”选项不起作用，系统将使用“output”。",
