	"The chat item is the first request in the session.": "聊天项是会话中的第一个请求。",
	"The chat view is a persistent interface that also supports navigating suggested follow-up questions, while the quick chat view is a transient interface for making and viewing requests.": "聊天视图是一个持久性界面，它还支持导航建议的后续问题，而快速聊天视图是用于发出和查看请求的暂时性界面。",
	"The chosen account, {0}, does not match the requested account, {1}.": "所选帐户 {0} 与请求的帐户 {1} 不匹配。",
	"The color of the border that separates split panes within the terminal. This defaults to panel.border.": "分隔终端中拆分窗格的边框的颜色。默认值为 panel.border 的颜色",
	"The color of the header container border.": "标头容器边框的颜色。",
	"The color of the icon for a port that has an associated running process.": "具有关联的正在运行的进程的端口图标颜色。",
