	"The default terminal profile on Windows.": "Windows 上的默认终端配置文件。",
	"The default value for the input.": "输入的默认值。",
	"The default value for this setting in the Agents window.": "此设置在智能体窗口中的默认值。",
	"The description in the markdown format.": "Markdown 格式的说明。",
