	"The description of the instruction file. It can be used to provide additional context or information about the instructions and is passed to the language model as part of the prompt.": "指令文件的说明。它可用于提供有关指令的其他上下文或信息，并传递到语言模型作为提示的一部分。",
	"The description of the reusable prompt, what it does and when to use it.": "有关可重用提示及其作用和使用时机的说明。",
