	"The description of the themable color": "主题颜色的说明",
	"The description of the themable icon": "主题图标的说明",
	"The diff state of item in the notebook diff editor, delete, insert, modified or unchanged": "笔记本差异编辑器中项的差异状态，删除、插入、已修改或未更改",
	"The display name of the language model chat provider.": "语言模型聊天提供程序的显示名称。",
