	"The enterprise-managed MCP server '{0}' did not advertise a protected-resource metadata document with a 'resource' identifier.": "企业管理的 MCP 服务器 \"{0}\" 未播发带有 \"resource\" 标识符的受保护资源元数据文档。",
	"The enterprise-managed MCP server '{0}' did not advertise an `authorization_servers` entry in its protected-resource metadata.": "企业管理的 MCP 服务器 \"{0}\" 未在其受保护资源元数据中播发 `authorization_servers` 条目。",
	"The enum options should be strings, but there is a non-string option. Please file an issue with the extension author.": "枚举选项应为字符串，但有一个非字符串选项。请向扩展作者提交问题。",
