	"The extension '{0}' wants to access the language models provided by {1}.": "扩展“{0}”想要访问 {1} 提供的语言模型。",
	"The extension '{0}' wants to sign in using {1}.": "扩展\"{0}\"希望使用{1}登录。",
	"The extension '{0}' wants you to sign in again using {1}.": "扩展“{0}”希望你使用 {1} 重新登录。",
