	"The file contains unhandled conflicts. Your changes will be lost if you don't save them.": "文件包含未处理的冲突。如果不保存更改，则更改将丢失。",
	"The file is too large to perform a replace all operation.": "文件太大，无法执行全部替换操作。",
	"The file pattern (or an array of patterns) to match, for example \"package.json\" or \"*.launch\". Exclusion patterns start with '!'": "要匹配的文件模式(或模式数组)，例如\"package.json\"或\"*. launch\"。排除模式以\"!\"开头",
	"The files contain unhandled conflicts.": "文件包含未经处理的冲突。",
	"The files contain unhandled conflicts. The merge results will be lost if you don't save them.": "文件包含未处理的冲突。如果不保存合并结果，合并结果将丢失。",
	"The files contain unhandled conflicts. Your changes will be lost if you don't save them.": "文件包含未经处理的冲突。如果不保存更改，则更改将丢失。",
	"The Focus Accessible Terminal View command<keybinding:{0}> enables screen readers to read terminal contents.": "焦点可访问终端视图命令<keybinding:{0}>使屏幕阅读器能够读取终端内容。",
	"The Focus Input Editor command{0} will bring the focus back to this editor.": "焦点输入编辑器命令{0} 会将焦点恢复到此编辑器。",
