	"The Focus Previous Cell Editor command{0} will set focus in the previous cell's editor.": "“聚焦到上一个单元格编辑器”命令 {0} 将在上一个单元格的编辑器中设置焦点。",
	"The folder {0} does not exist. Would you like to create it?": "文件夹 {0} 不存在。是否要创建它?",
