	"The folder icon for collapsed folders, and if folderExpanded is not set, also for expanded folders.": "折叠文件夹的文件夹图标，如果未设置 folderExpanded，也指展开文件夹的文件夹图标。",
	"The folder icon for collapsed root folders, and if rootFolderExpanded is not set, also for expanded root folders.": "折叠的根文件夹的文件夹图标，如果未设置 rootFolderExpanded，也指展开的根文件夹的文件夹图标。",
	"The folder icon for expanded folders. The expanded folder icon is optional. If not set, the icon defined for folder will be shown.": "展开文件夹的文件夹图标。展开文件夹图标是可选的。如果未设置，将显示为文件夹定义的图标。",
	"The folder icon for expanded root folders. The expanded root folder icon is optional. If not set, the icon defined for root folder will be shown.": "展开的根文件夹的文件夹图标。展开的根文件夹图标是可选的。如果未设置，将显示为根文件夹定义的图标。",
	"The following dependencies required for sandboxed execution are not installed: {0}. Would you like to install them?": "未安装沙盒执行所需的以下依赖项: {0}。是否想要安装它们?",
	"The following editors with unsaved changes could not be saved or reverted.": "无法保存或还原以下具有未保存更改的编辑器。",
	"The following editors with unsaved changes could not be saved to the backup location.": "以下具有未保存更改的编辑器无法保存到备份位置。",
	"The following extensions contain dependency loops and have been disabled: {0}": "以下扩展因包含依赖循环已被禁用: {0}",
	"The following files have been closed and modified on disk: {0}.": "以下文件已关闭并且已在磁盘上修改: {0}。",
