	"The following operations are still running: \n{0}": "以下操作仍在运行: \r\n{0}",
	"The following table outlines the data sent with each setting:": "下表概述了每个设置所发送的数据:",
	"The following workspace folders are ignored since they use task version 0.1.0: {0}": "由于使用任务版本 0.1.0，以下工作区文件夹将被忽略: {0}",
	"The font character associated with the icon definition.": "与图标定义关联的字体字符。",
