	"The input box is where the user can type a request and can make the request ({0}). The widget will be closed and all content will be discarded when the Escape key is pressed and the terminal will regain focus.": "输入框是用户可以键入请求并可以发出请求的位置({0})。按 Escape 键后，将会关闭小组件并放弃所有内容，然后终端将重新处于焦点模式。",
