	"The MCP server \"{0}\" has issued a request to make a language model call. Do you want to allow it to make requests, outside of tool calls during chat?": "MCP 服务器 “{0}” 已发出请求以进行语言模型调用。是否希望允许它在聊天期间发出请求，但不通过工具调用?",
