	"The MCP server {0} may have new tools and requires interaction to start. [Start it now?]({1})": "MCP 服务器 {0} 可能有新工具，需要交互才能启动。[现在启动?]({1})",
	"The MCP server {0} reported potential sandbox blocks. Olympia IDE found possible sandbox configuration updates:\n{1}": "MCP 服务器 {0} 报告了潜在的沙盒阻止。Olympia 发现了可能的沙盒配置更新:\r\n{1}",
	"The MCP server {0} was updated. MCP servers may add context to your chat session and lead to unexpected behavior. Do you want to trust and run this server?": "MCP 服务器 {0} 已更新。MCP 服务器可能会向你的聊天会话添加上下文并导致意外行为。你是否要信任并运行此服务器?",
	"The MCP Server Definition '{0}' wants to authenticate to {1}.": "MCP 服务器定义“{0}”要求向 {1} 进行身份验证。",
