	"The RegExp pattern for afterText.": "afterText 的正则表达式模式。",
	"The RegExp pattern for beforeText.": "beforeText 的正则表达式模式。",
	"The RegExp pattern for decreaseIndentPattern.": "decreaseIndentPattern 的正则表达式模式。",
	"The RegExp pattern for increaseIndentPattern.": "increaseIndentPattern 的正则表达式模式。",
	"The RegExp pattern for indentNextLinePattern.": "indentNextLinePattern 的正则表达式模式。",
	"The RegExp pattern for previousLineText.": "previousLineText 的正则表达式模式。",
	"The RegExp pattern for the end marker.": "结束标记的 RegExp 模式。",
	"The RegExp pattern for the end marker. The regexp must start with '^'.": "结束标记的正则表达式模式。其应以 \"^\" 开始。",
	"The RegExp pattern for the start marker.": "开始标记的 RegExp 模式。",
