	"The RegExp pattern for unIndentedLinePattern.": "unIndentedLinePattern 的正则表达式模式。",
	"The RegExp pattern used to match words.": "用于匹配文本的正则表达式模式。",
	"The regular expression to detect the begin or end of a background task.": "用于检测后台任务开始或结束的正则表达式。",
	"The regular expression to find an error, warning or info in the output.": "用于在输出中查找错误、警告或信息的正则表达式。",
	"The remote extension host terminated unexpectedly. Restarting...": "远程扩展主机意外终止。正在重启...",
	"The remote server where the workspace is located.": "工作区所在的远程服务器。",
	"The renderer does not require messaging.": "呈现器不需要消息传递。",
