	"This workspace has tasks ({0}) defined ({1}) that can launch processes automatically when you open this workspace. Do you want to allow automatic tasks to run in all trusted workspaces?": "此工作区定义了任务({0}) ({1})，这些任务可以在你打开此工作区时自动启动进程。是否允许自动任务在所有受信任的工作区中运行?",
