	"To include or exclude thinking content in the accessible view, run the Toggle Thinking Content in Accessible View command from the Command Palette.": "要在可访问视图中包含或排除思考内容，请从命令面板运行“切换可访问视图中的思考内容”命令。",
	"To insert the code block, open a code editor or notebook editor and set the cursor at the location where to insert the code block.": "若要插入代码块，请打开代码编辑器或笔记本编辑器，并在插入代码块的位置设置光标。",
	"To navigate to the next user prompt in the conversation, invoke the Next User Prompt command{0}.": "若要导航到对话中的下一个用户提示，请调用“下一个用户提示”命令 {0}。",
	"To navigate to the previous user prompt in the conversation, invoke the Previous User Prompt command{0}.": "若要导航到对话中的上一个用户提示，请调用“上一个用户提示”命令 {0}。",
	"To open the Agents Window, invoke the Open Agents Window command{0}. In screen reader mode, this keybinding includes Alt to avoid conflicts with screen reader shortcuts.": "若要打开智能体窗口，请调用“打开智能体窗口”命令 {0}。在屏幕阅读器模式下，此键绑定包含 Alt，以避免与屏幕阅读器快捷方式冲突。",
	"To permanently delete a chat, open the chat tab's context menu and choose Delete Chat. This is destructive and cannot be undone.": "要永久删除聊天，请打开聊天选项卡的上下文菜单，然后选择“删除聊天”。这是破坏性操作，并且无法撤消。",
	"To read from stdin, append '-' (e.g. '{0}')": "要从 stdin 中读取，请追加 \"-\" (例如 \"{0}\")",
	"To remove attached contexts, focus an attachment and press Delete or Backspace.": "若要移除附加的上下文，请聚焦附件并按 Delete 或 Backspace。",
	"To return to the last chat response you focused, invoke the Focus Last Focused Chat Response command{0}.": "若要返回到聚焦的上一个聊天响应，请调用“聚焦上个聚焦的聊天响应”命令 {0}。",
