	"Whether CustomExecution tasks are supported. Consider using in the when clause of a 'taskDefinition' contribution.": "是否支持 CustomExecution 任务。请考虑在 \"taskDefinition\" 贡献的 when 子句中使用。",
	"Whether delegation is supported. Default is false. Note that enabling this is experimental and may not be respected at all times.": "是否支持委派。默认值为 false。请注意，启用此功能属于实验性质，可能并非在所有情况下都生效。",
	"Whether focus is in a chat editor.": "焦点是否在聊天编辑器中。",
	"Whether inline completions are currently snoozed": "当前是否推迟内联补全",
	"Whether inserting the current suggestion yields in a change or has everything already been typed": "插入当前建议是否会导致更改或导致已键入所有内容",
	"Whether invoking the command puts the chat into a persistent mode, where the command is automatically added to the chat input for the next message.": "调用命令是否将聊天置于持久模式，其中该命令会自动添加到下一条消息的聊天输入中。",
	"Whether it is possible to navigate back in editor edit locations history": "是否可在编辑器编辑位置历史记录中向后导航",
	"Whether it is possible to navigate back in editor history": "是否可在编辑器历史记录中向后导航",
