	"Whether it is possible to navigate to the last editor edit location": "是否可导航到最后一个编辑器编辑位置",
	"Whether it is possible to navigate to the last editor navigation location": "是否可导航到最后一个编辑器导航位置",
	"Whether it is possible to reopen the last closed editor": "是否可重新打开上次关闭的编辑器",
	"Whether keyboard focus is inside the quick open control": "键盘焦点是否在快速打开控件中",
	"Whether more than one session is visible in the sessions part's grid": "会话部分的网格中是否可见多个会话",
	"Whether new shells should inherit their environment from Olympia IDE, which may source a login shell to ensure $PATH and other development variables are initialized. This has no effect on Windows.": "新 shell 是否应从 Olympia 继承其环境，这可能会生成登录 shell，以确保初始化 $PATH 和其他开发变量。这不会对 Windows 造成影响。",
	"Whether Olympia IDE's auto-reply setting is enabled. When `true`, `ask_user` questions are auto-answered instead of blocking on the user, mirroring autopilot mode.": "Olympia 的自动回复设置是否已启用。当为 `true` 时，会自动回答 `ask_user` 问题，而不是阻止用户，从而镜像 autopilot 模式。",
	"Whether Olympia IDE's global auto-approve setting is enabled. When `true`, every tool call is auto-approved, equivalent to a session using Allow all.": "Olympia 的全局自动批准设置是否已启用。当为 `true` 时，会自动批准每个工具调用，等同于使用“绕过批准”的会话。",
	"Whether or not to replace the dynamic terminal title that detects what program is running with the static profile name.": "是否将检测正在运行程序的动态终端标题替换为静态配置文件名称。",
	"Whether ProcessExecution tasks are supported. Consider using in the when clause of a 'taskDefinition' contribution.": "是否支持 ProcessExecution 任务。请考虑在 \"taskDefinition\" 贡献的 when 子句中使用。",
	"Whether remote session sync is enabled for the copilot-sdk CLI.": "是否为 copilot-sdk CLI 启用远程会话同步。",
	"Whether semantic highlighting is enabled or disabled for this theme": "是否对此主题启用或禁用语义突出显示",
