	"Whether terminal auto-approve rules forwarded by the connected client are allowed to apply to agent-host shell permission requests.": "是否允许连接的客户端转发的终端自动批准规则应用于智能体主机 shell 权限请求。",
	"Whether test coverage should be down in the File Explorer view.": "是否应在“文件资源管理器”视图中降低测试覆盖。",
