	"Whether the chat session relies on a GitHub Copilot account and so cannot be used until the user signs in. Defaults to false.": "聊天会话是否依赖于 GitHub Copilot 帐户，因此在用户登录前无法使用。默认为 false。",
	"Whether the chat session supports the synthetic \"Auto\" model fallback. Defaults to false. When true and no models are available, the picker shows \"Auto\" instead of a \"No models available\" state.": "聊天会话是否支持合成的“自动”模型回退。默认为 false。当此项为 true 且无可用模型时，选取器会显示“自动”，而不是“无可用模型”状态。",
