	"You can reopen or close the window or keep waiting.": "你可以重新打开或关闭窗口，或者保持等待。",
	"You can still access the menu bar by pressing the Alt-key.": "你仍可以通过 Alt 键访问菜单栏。",
	"You can unarchive sessions later if needed from the sessions view.": "如果需要，可以稍后从会话视图中还原会话。",
